We finally finished the patch! We’re terribly sorry for it taking so long to fix the game. We hope that it’ll solve the major problems though, especially with crashes.

Changelog:
- New save system (please read below);
- Bug and localization fixes;
- New event in the forest;
- The book quest now has a tutorial dialogue;
- New dialogue lines near the house;
- The brightness option added;
- Control scheme in the main menu; 
- Now you can disable camerasway.

Because now the save system is reworked, the old save files will be deleted. Those who already played will have to start anew. We apologise for the trouble.

Steam Trading Cards cannot be added yet because of the Steam control system. Linux and MacOS versions, just like the gamepad support, are planned.

