So, Fariwalk The Prelude finally released. This is our first paid project, and, unfortunately, not everything went as our humble team consisting of one and a half people had planned. This is an important experience, and we'll work hard to prevent such problems in future. 

However, the work on the Prelude is not finished. Our short-term plans are as follows:

- to add trading cards;
- to add the gamepad support;
- to add Linux and Mac versions;
- to fix bugs and translation errors when they're discovered.

Aside from that, we want to release the first tale from our another project, a third-person adventure IH8, in the beginning of 2018.

Fariwalk will return as an episodic game in 2018.

We look forward to your feedback.

